The translations are maintained here, in this repository, as ordinary .po
files. To correct a translation, edit its .po file; to add a language, add
<language>.po and list the language in LINGUAS. Either way, send a pull
request to https://github.com/UnitedMarsupials/tdlib-purple

Up to 0.8.1 the translations came from upstream's Transifex project,
    https://www.transifex.com/tdlib-purple-developers/tdlib-purple/
which this fork does not use: nothing is fetched from there any more.

After translatable strings change in the code, regenerate the template,
tdlib-purple.pot, with refresh-potfile.sh.
